  "mach:weightsLicense": "CC-BY-NC-ND-4.0",
  "mach:trainingDataSummary": "Self-supervised pretraining on ~1.55 million curated T1w, T2w, and FLAIR brain MRI scans from 428,647 studies across 282,693 patients at NYU Langone Health. The underlying clinical pretraining data is private/PHI and is not released; only model weights are distributed (gated, approval required). Base architecture: 3D ViT-Base with sparse Mixture-of-Experts (V-JEPA 2 latent-predictive objective).",
  "mach:intendedUse": "Academic neuroimaging research — brain MRI feature extraction and downstream fine-tuning for diagnosis, prognosis, age prediction, time-to-event analysis, and multimodal learning across T1w/T2w/FLAIR. Restricted to non-commercial research use. Not a cleared medical device and not validated for clinical decision-making.",
  "mach:aiActRiskClass": "high-risk-candidate",
